flowchart LR
    A[(CSV Dataset)] -->|Pandas Load| B(DataFrame)
    B -->|Extract 'comb'| C(Text Features)
    C -->|CountVectorizer| D{Feature Matrix}

    E[User Input] -->|difflib match| F(Resolved Title)
    F -->|Index Lookup| G(Target Vector)

    D -->|Cosine Similarity| H(Similarity Scores)
    G -->|Cosine Similarity| H

    H -->|Sort Descending| I(Top 10 Indices)
    I -->|Locate in DataFrame| J(Recommendations)

    J -->|Render| K[Streamlit UI]

    classDef default fill:#161b22,stroke:#30363d,stroke-width:1px,color:#c9d1d9;
    classDef data fill:#1f6feb,stroke:#1f6feb,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff,fill-opacity:0.2;
    classDef process fill:#d29922,stroke:#d29922,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff,fill-opacity:0.2;

    class A,B data;
    class D,H process;
